1.8 Problem Statement
Farmers in Thigio area face major challenges in poultry production, including high feed costs, disease outbreaks, water shortages, climate variability, and unstable markets. These challenges lead to reduced profitability and low production efficiency.
There was therefore a need to establish a climate-smart indigenous chicken broiler enterprise that would:
•	Improve production efficiency.
•	Reduce production costs.
•	Enhance disease control.
•	Improve water use efficiency.
•	Promote value addition.
•	Improve marketing.
•	Increase profitability.
